api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Few other issues:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTitle height is not accounting for icon height, and font height in case of empty text.\r\n![Screenshot 2025-02-04 104650](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0602992a-2162-471d-88a6-57e3aac48c07)\r\nProbably should be something like: `MAX(text.hegith, icon.height, font.height)` to ensure all elements fit regardless of empty text or font icon size.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOverrun width is not accounting for added control size:\r\n![Screenshot 2025-02-04 110653](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab72fd97-a013-414f-8f4f-cd348fee0348)\r\n\r\nNote: word overrun seems to be broken for `TextLine` (not-related to this PR, I'll fix it in a moment), so it should be tested with `Ellipsis` or `Character`.\r\n\r\nEverything else seems to be working well. I also fully agree with the decision to use generic add/remove control instead of buttons only.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2592222140","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102346#pullrequestreview-2592222140"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102346"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-04T09:34:28Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2594773819,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6aqRs7","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2